{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20150","headline":"寿安西渡奉别郑相公 一 · 孟郊","name":"寿安西渡奉别郑相公 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛河向西道，石波横磷磷。\n清风送君子，车远无还尘。\n春别亦萧索，况兹冰霜晨。\n零落景易入，郁抑抱难申。\n百宵华灯宴，一旦星散人。\n岁去弦吐箭，忧来蚕抽纶。\n绵绵无穷事，各各驰遶身。\n徘徊黄缥缈，倏忽春霜宾。\n相爲物表物，永谢区中姻。\n日嗟来教士，仰望无由亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}